Let me look at the `_gnutls_x509_decode_string` function more carefully. The key issue might be in how it handles the decoded string:

```c
ret = asn1_decode_simple_ber(etype, der, der_size, &str, &str_size, NULL);
if (ret != ASN1_SUCCESS) {
    gnutls_assert();
    ret = _gnutls_asn2err(ret);
    return ret;
}

td.size = str_size;
td.data = gnutls_malloc(str_size + 1);
if (td.data == NULL)
    return gnutls_assert_val(GNUTLS_E_MEMORY_ERROR);

memcpy(td.data, str, str_size);
td.data[str_size] = 0;

if (allow_ber)
    free(str);
```

